ayenne Pepper|Cayenne pepper]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], roughly chopped\n* Salt\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n# [[Cookbook:Boiling|Boil]] the cabbage until tender. Drain.\n# [[Cookbook:Frying|Fry]] the chopped bacon in butter.\n# Combine the cooked cabbage, bacon, parsley, egg, cheese, cayenne, and chopped onion. Season to taste with salt.\n# Transfer mixture to a glass [[Cookbook:Baking Dish|baking dish]]. [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] 15 minutes at 180˚C.\n# Serve with toasted bread.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using bacon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using green cabbage]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cheese]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cayenne]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Baked Cabbage and Bacon","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 head of green cabbage, sliced and/or diced","sourceText":"1 head of green cabbage, sliced and/or diced","amountText":"1 head of green cabbage, sliced and/or diced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"Bacon, chopped","sourceText":"Bacon, chopped","amountText":"Bacon, chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"Butter","sourceText":"Butter","amountText":"Butter","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"Parsley","sourceText":"Parsley","amountText":"Parsley","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 egg","sourceText":"1 egg","amountText":"1 egg","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"Grated cheese","sourceText":"Grated cheese","amountText":"Grated cheese","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"Cayenne pepper","sourceText":"Cayenne pepper","amountText":"Cayenne pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"½ onion, roughly chopped","sourceText":"½ onion, roughly cho